ps://api.github.com/users/MarkAtwood/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkAtwood/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkAtwood/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkAtwood/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkAtwood/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-06-27T14:52:58Z","updated_at":"2019-06-27T14:53:40Z","body":"I recommend scoped license id   LicenseRef-.google.com.-PATENTS-{modiferstuff}","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/506380117/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/569969690","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/646#issuecomment-569969690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/646","id":569969690,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2OTk2OTY5MA==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-12-31T18:21:07Z","updated_at":"2019-12-31T18:21:07Z","body":"This one has been sitting inactive for quite a while. I had originally drafted a PR for it but then withdrew it.\r\n\r\nMy main concern is that, having dug into them more closely, I don't think these can be appropriately described as \"exceptions.\" I think that in most if not all other cases, an \"exception\" is something that in essence boils down to \"you don't have to do X.\" E.g., \"you can link my GPL code with project X and distribute them even though X isn't under GPL\"; or \"if you do Y then you don't need to comply with section 4 of the license\"; or so on.\r\n\r\nI don't think these Google patent grants really fit that framework. They aren't exceptions to the underlying license. If anything, it's arguably more like a modification to the underlying license, almost comparable to something like the Commons Clause.\r\n\r\nThere was a discussion a while back about whether the \"exceptions list\" should be something broader -- license modifications? something else? -- but I don't think an appropriate alternative term was ever settled on. So unless that discussion is reopened, I'm kind of inclined to just close this issue, because I really don't feel that the \"exception\" label fits here.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/569969690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/820544158","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/646#issuecomment-820544158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/646","id":820544158,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyMDU0NDE1OA==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-15T16:00:09Z","updated_at":"2021-04-15T16:00:09Z","body":"I'm closing this for now - we never got feedback from Google, it's really old, and it cuts into a bigger conversation about the scope of \"exceptions\" and what that includes. we can revisit if/when we revisit that conversation.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/820544158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]